  "notes": "{突|つ}きつける is a compound verb from {突|つ}く (to poke/thrust) and つける (to attach/direct toward). It conveys a forceful, aggressive action.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ナイフを{突|つ}きつける (thrust a knife at someone)\n- {証拠|しょうこ}を{突|つ}きつける (confront someone with evidence)\n- {辞表|じひょう}を{突|つ}きつける (present a resignation letter forcefully)\n- {現実|げんじつ}を{突|つ}きつける (confront someone with reality)",
